          "kicker": "Coaching search",
          "heading": "Jake White remains linked to Fiji head coach vacancy following departure",
          "body": "Reports continue to associate Jake White with the vacant Fiji head coach position following the mutual agreement to part ways with Mick Byrne earlier this year. The search for a successor remains a primary focus for Fiji Rugby as the national side navigates a challenging season. While no official appointment has been confirmed by the union, White is identified in media coverage as a leading candidate to step into the role and steer the programme toward future international assignments."
        }
