      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection ambition",
          "heading": "Joe Carpenter targets George Furbank duel to reignite England Test career",
          "body": "Sale full-back Joe Carpenter has identified this weekend’s match against Harlequins as a crucial opportunity to challenge George Furbank for a spot in Steve Borthwick’s England squad. Carpenter, who earned his sole Test cap in 2025, has used a full pre-season to focus on his fitness and attacking consistency. Admitting that outshining the incumbent Furbank is a clear motivation, Carpenter stated, “It would be nice to have a very good performance against them and against that England competition.”"
        },
