        {
          "kicker": "Training insight",
          "heading": "Victor Wembanyama credits French club Provence for inspiring team spirit",
          "body": "NBA star Victor Wembanyama has reflected on his recent training stint with second-tier side Provence, highlighting the club’s camaraderie as a major inspiration. The 22-year-old spent time with the squad during their pre-season, participating in line-out drills and tackle-pad sessions to develop his movement patterns. Wembanyama noted he was moved by the collective unity within the group, stating, \"It was very inspiring to see the relationship between team-mates, coaches and fans. I have never been welcomed anywhere like this.\""
