          "kicker": "Urc discipline",
          "heading": "Bundee Aki faces scrutiny following another heated outburst against Glasgow Warriors",
          "body": "Bundee Aki is under the spotlight following a fractious display during Connacht’s 36-19 defeat to Glasgow Warriors in Friday’s URC fixture. The Ireland centre was involved in a performance that saw his side struggle physically, as the visitors were \"mauled to death\" with four of the five opposition tries stemming from driving lineouts. Reports from the match highlighted a frustrated display from the international, noting another instance of a \"lippy\" outburst during a difficult evening at Scotstoun."
