          "heading": "Italy maintains high-water mark for best-ever international world ranking position",
          "body": "Italy has previously reached a high-water mark of No. 8 in the world rankings. This position was first achieved in 2007 and was matched again in 2024. As the team prepares for the upcoming Nations Championship, they currently sit 11th in the competition log after three matches. The squad has recorded 37 points for and 131 points against throughout their current campaign, resulting in a points difference of -94."
