          "kicker": "Transfer interest",
          "heading": "Edinburgh scrum-half Hector Patterson attracts interest from English club Bath",
          "body": "Edinburgh scrum-half Hector Patterson is reportedly attracting interest from Premiership side Bath as he enters the final year of his contract. The 21-year-old, son of former Scotland international Derrick Patterson, has emerged as a talent after representing Scotland at age-grade level and winning the 2024 World Rugby U20 Trophy. While currently committed to Edinburgh, his eligibility to represent England through a grandparent leaves his international future open until he is captured at senior level."
