          "kicker": "Premiership form",
          "heading": "Four Welsh stars impress as Reffell and Wainwright shine for Leicester",
          "body": "Tommy Reffell and Aaron Wainwright spearheaded a notable Welsh contribution during Leicester Tigers’ 38-31 Gallagher Premiership win over Gloucester. Reffell was described as a \"nuisance\" at the breakdown, with his try-saving tackle in the second half earning particular praise. Wainwright, meanwhile, crossed for his first try for his new club. Fellow Welshmen Jac Morgan, who impressed for the visitors, and Olly Cracknell, who completed 16 tackles for the victors, were also highlighted for their standout individual performances."
