          "kicker": "Coaching staff",
          "heading": "Shaun Edwards confirms Argentina deal as Felipe Contepomi finalises backroom team",
          "body": "Shaun Edwards has finalised his coaching future, confirming he will join Felipe Contepomi’s Argentina backroom staff following the conclusion of his consultancy with the Red Roses on 30 October. The former France defence coach, who is contracted until the 2027 Rugby World Cup, stated, \"I’m thrilled to be joining Felipe Contepomi, his coaching staff, and the Argentinian team.\" Edwards will begin his role ahead of the upcoming Nations Championship fixtures, working alongside newly appointed forwards coach Mario Ledesma."
