    "463": {
      "date": "2026-10-11",
      "edition": "Sunday 11 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Tour review",
          "heading": "Sakura XV return from Europe winless ahead of Wales double-header",
          "body": "The Japan Sakura XV are set to regroup following a difficult four-match winless streak in Europe, concluding with back-to-back defeats against Ireland in the WXV Global Series. Despite a promising start in Cork—where the side briefly led 7-0 through a Sakurako Korai rolling maul—the team struggled to contain Irish scrum dominance and were ultimately punished by a clinical kicking game. Japan now turn their attention to a two-test home series against Wales, aiming to refine their defensive line speed."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
